as much as I love Jackson,

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:05.660
I wanted more space and
just, I like being alone.

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:07.640
I'm a loner by nature. I love being alone.

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:11.530
