they start to play together.

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:32.330
- That's exactly...

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:33.163
- They You have time to pee alone.

00:02:33.163 --> 00:02:33.996
- Yeah. That's exactly right.

00:02:33.996 --> 00:02:35.613
(audience applauding)

00:02:35.613 --> 00:02:38.640
You're right. Yeah, but
I'm one and done for me.

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:41.960
But, I love being in Jackson.
I love the fresh air.

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:42.793
I love it all.

00:02:42.793 --> 00:02:44.320
- [Kelly] Oh man. It's
so nice. I hear that.

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:46.500
