00:02:52.931 --> 00:02:54.060
- [Tyler] 100%.

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:56.646
- But no, my moose, they
stay in the wooded areas.

00:02:56.646 --> 00:02:57.750
- I love that you call your
moose, did you name them?

00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:58.929
- My moose, I own them.

00:02:58.929 --> 00:02:59.762
- You didn't yeah.

00:02:59.762 --> 00:03:01.060
- No, I just mean, I see
them in like the woods.

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:02.560
They don't ever come up to my house,

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:05.520
but yours literally sit
in front of your door.

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:06.918
- Oh yeah. In front of the door.

00:03:06.918 --> 00:03:08.528
The first time I ever saw one...

00:03:08.528 --> 00:03:09.361
- [Kelly] They're dangerous.

00:03:09.361 --> 00:03:10.194
- Yeah. They're very dangerous.

00:03:10.194 --> 00:03:11.490
I was working out in the gym.
The garage doors were open.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:14.180
I'm working out and this
huge shadow pass by,

00:03:14.180 --> 00:03:16.187
and I go, what is that? It's this moose.

00:03:16.187 --> 00:03:19.630
He's about nine feet tall with
the antlers and everything.

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:20.463
- Rack is huge.Yeah.

00:03:20.463 --> 00:03:22.660
- I was like, oh my gosh! But yeah.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:23.930
- And they're terrifying.

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:25.776
- And there's a place
where I sit and write

00:03:25.776 --> 00:03:27.840
around a little fire pit and they love it.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:30.080
He'll go out there and he
tearing up the chairs and all.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:31.680
So I'm like, listen, you were here first.

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:33.307
You could have it. I'll just
stay up here in the house.

00:03:33.307 --> 00:03:34.140
(Kelly laughing)

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:35.120
I'm not going out there.

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:35.995
- Not going near that chair.

00:03:35.995 --> 00:03:37.890
So last time you were
here I thought you said

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:38.960
you were like, "No, I'm done with Madea."

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:39.930
And I love that you brought her back.

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:42.235
I feel like we need
her. She makes me laugh.

00:03:42.235 --> 00:03:43.068
(audience cheering)

00:03:43.068 --> 00:03:43.901
- I tell you...

00:03:43.901 --> 00:03:45.083
- She makes me so happy.

00:03:45.083 --> 00:03:46.750
- I tell you what happened,

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:48.140
and that's exactly why I brought it back.

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:50.610
Looking at the pandemic,
looking at all the social

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:52.650
and civil unrest, looking at
all the madness and looking

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:53.737
at everything that's
happening in the country.

00:03:53.737 --> 00:03:55.070
I'm like, we need to laugh.

00:03:55.070 --> 00:03:56.470
All of our smiles were covered up.

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:58.260
I'm like, what do I have in my toolbox

00:03:58.260 --> 00:03:59.210
that will make people laugh?

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.590
And I open it up and
somebody says, "Hello!"

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:04.930
And here we are so yeah,
on Netflix. I'm excited.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:06.780
- I know it makes me so happy.

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:08.742
And I love this was specific.

00:04:08.742 --> 00:04:12.360
You spoke about LGBTQ
community in this one,

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:13.193
and I think it's cool.

00:04:13.193 --> 00:04:14.810
It's a different message for this "Madea."

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:16.150
Was that really important to you?

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:18.830
- Yeah, again, looking at
the trauma and the heartache

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:21.920
and how much every everybody
has to say about other people

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:22.980
and the way they live their lives.

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:24.850
You get one life, life is short, right.

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:26.440
So I wanted to show a gay character,

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:28.410
coming out to his family, a Black family.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.870
And they're embracing
him and showing him love.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:31.771
- I was gonna say, I loved that.

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:33.627
I love that it actually did that.

00:04:33.627 --> 00:04:36.370
It wasn't like the typical
like, oh, it's hard.

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:38.630
'Cause yes, it is hard for people.

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:39.850
I have friends that it was hard for

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:41.700
and some of their family
don't talk to them,

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:43.590
but some are embraced, they embrace it,

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:44.960
they love you, it's not a big deal.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:46.490
And I think we don't hear
those stories enough.

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:47.730
- That's why it was so
important for me to show.

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:50.750
'Cause I do a lot of work
with Covenant House who,

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:53.690
over the years they have,
a lot of kids are homeless

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:56.250
because they were put out
because they were LGBTQ plus.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.330
And to see...

00:04:58.330 --> 00:04:59.403
- Can you imagine that?
We're both parents.

00:04:59.403 --> 00:05:00.990
- It's so horrible.

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:02.150
I don't even know how, listen,

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:03.900
I couldn't even imagine the love that

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.871
I have for my child.

00:05:05.871 --> 00:05:06.704
- [Kelly] Infinite.

00:05:06.704 --> 00:05:07.908
- Infinite, you know?

00:05:07.908 --> 00:05:10.360
And to think because of
the way they were born,

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:12.272
you would really just
discard them, is shocking

00:05:12.272 --> 00:05:14.230
to me that people can do that.

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:15.870
- Yeah, I don't get that either.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.930
I think it's really cool that you use

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:19.950
a powerful message in such a powerful way

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:21.050
because people love to laugh.

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:23.421
They love to, they're already
a part of this character.

00:05:23.421 --> 00:05:24.903
- [Madea] Thank you baby. I appreciate it.

00:05:24.903 --> 00:05:28.010
I appreciate it so much.
I appreciate so much.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:31.133
I appreciate babe. I've
been around long time.

00:05:31.133 --> 00:05:32.207
- This is what I love too.

00:05:32.207 --> 00:05:34.730
I love that you took Madea,
and you made these posters.

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:35.780
I was dying.

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:36.613
- Oh listen.

00:05:36.613 --> 00:05:37.446
- Wait, so here's some of the posters.

00:05:37.446 --> 00:05:38.866
