00:05:38.866 --> 00:05:41.020
(everyone laughing)

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.910
Which is amazing.

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:46.150
Wait, this is Madeagerton.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:47.303
- [Tyler] That's right, you said it right.

00:05:47.303 --> 00:05:49.520
- Madeagerton. Oh my God.

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:51.040
First of all, wait, keep it up.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:53.340
Guy on the right is the
