but it is a good shift.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:59.620
I think that would be good
for society in general.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:00.690
- I would hope so.

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:02.830
I'm worried about where
we're headed as a society.

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:03.760
- [Kelly] Jesus take the wheel.

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:06.290
- Yeah. Literally, right.

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:09.530
- I had to literally like,
I'm going through a divorce.

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:10.480
It's been a rough two years.

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:12.050
I had to literally turn off the news,

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:12.970
which I don't like doing.

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:16.350
'Cause I like to be informed,
but it was just too much.

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:19.310
Like I found myself in therapy,
just bawling for the world,

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.143
myself, everything.

00:08:20.143 --> 00:08:23.090
I was like, everything's on fire.

00:08:23.090 --> 00:08:24.010
I was like, what's happening?

00:08:24.010 --> 00:08:26.960
But it's not, there are
kind things happening.

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:28.970
- But then you have these
beautiful beings looking

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:32.629
at you, your kids, if you
hadn't been through that,

00:08:32.629 --> 00:08:34.210
you know, they wouldn't be here right?

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:35.043
- [Kelly] Yes, absolutely.

00:08:35.043 --> 00:08:38.057
- And you have to constantly refocus on,

00:08:38.057 --> 00:08:39.583
"This is good. This is okay. I'm okay."

00:08:39.583 --> 00:08:41.460
And, and tell yourself you're okay.

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:42.440
We're gonna move through this.

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:43.710
We're gonna get to a better place.

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:45.197
And, and before you know it, you're there.

00:08:45.197 --> 00:08:47.040
I know it sounds like a cliche.

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:48.880
- No, it would be easier
to move and navigate that

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:51.600
though through a more positive
kind of society instead

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:53.653
of everybody, you know, kind of attacking.

